playwright:
    - pip install playwright
    - Core Playwright API
    - This installs Playwright core (browser automation, API & bindings)
    - But not the pytest integration

Pytest:
    - pip install pytest-playwright
    - installs pytest plugin for playwright
    - Write tests using pytest structure (def test_..)
    - Use fixtures like page, browser, etc., without manually launching the browser.

Pytest is a testing framework for python
    - used to write simple, scalable and readable test cases.

